  "captions": {
    "fig05_fpga_resources": "Whole-design FPGA resource utilization for the original CVE2 and the isqrt extension, parsed from Vivado out-of-context post-synthesis reports. Total LUTs and FFs use the top-level utilization row; CARRY4 counts come from the synthesis primitive table. Both designs include the same wrapper and processor configuration. Panel scales differ. The DSP belongs to the existing multiplier; no implemented area is claimed.",
    "fig06_fpga_timing": "Worst setup and hold slack parsed from the complete design timing summaries for both cores at the same clock target. Nonnegative slack meets the corresponding check. Original core passes setup; with isqrt fails setup. Original core fails hold; with isqrt fails hold. These are out-of-context post-synthesis estimates with an unset HD.CLK_SRC clock context. They do not establish routed timing closure or implemented Fmax."
  },
